[2026-10-07T09:51:36.941Z] Possible reasons for having these kinds of units are:
[2026-10-07T09:51:36.941Z] • A unit may be statically enabled by being symlinked from another unit's
[2026-10-07T09:51:36.941Z]   .wants/, .requires/, or .upholds/ directory.
